'''Sub Horfs''' are a variant of Horfs found in {{s|Downpour}}, {{s|Dross}} and rarely replace Horfs in other floors. Sub Horfs look like Horfs but are tinted blue in Downpour and rotten green in Dross; the random replacements in other floors are identical.

Sub Horfs will only shoot if hit first. If they are shot at, they will rotate and periodically shoot in the direction they are facing while rotating. They will also shoot upon receiving any knockback. They release 1 water shot upon death. Despite appearing to float, Sub Horfs can be pushed by the water streams in {{S|Dross}}.
{{clear}}

