'''Level 2 Horfs''' are a variant of Horfs found in {{s|Corpse}}. They look like Horfs in a decaying state.

Level 2 Horfs act quite similarly to regular Horfs; however, they spit {{E|Small Maggot}}s at Isaac instead of blood shots. Although they appear to float, they cannot get past gaps in the floor and are affected by [[creep]].
