== Trivia ==
* {{E|Maw}}s and {{E|Psychic Maw}}s appear to be the posthumous versions of Horfs and Psychic Horfs, as their attacks and appearance are similar.
* Even though Horfs look like they are flying, they are considered grounded.
** However, they do fly in {{r|Crawl Space}}s and can be hit down.
* {{dlc|r}} [[anti:Sub Horf|Sub Horfs]] appeared in the ''Antibirth'' mod, where they would only fire upon receiving any knockback.
* {{dlc+|r}} Sub Horfs spawned outside of {{s|Downpour}} will have the same coloration as a normal Horf.
** Their bullets are also colored the same as normal horf bullets.{{dlc-}}

